          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "11282B69A28503C2",
      "text": "Da ist noch etwas Luft nach oben, würde ich\\nsagen, hoho!\\c\\nAber du bist ja gerade erst hier angekommen.\\nDas wird schon noch![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "11282669A284FB43",
      "text": "Das sind immerhin schon ein paar Einträge...\\c\\nLass dich von deiner Abenteuerlust leiten und\\nerkunde verschiedene Gebiete![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "11282569A284F990",
      "text": "Du hast da schon eine Menge beisammen!\\c\\nEs gibt ganz schön viele verschiedene Pokémon\\nhier, nicht wahr?\\c\\nDie Temperaturregulierung der Tera-Kuppel\\nkostet übrigens auch einen Haufen Geld...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "11282869A284FEA9",
      "text": "Du hast ganz schön viele Pokémon registriert!\\c\\nDu bist so nah dran, jetzt musst du den Pokédex\\ndoch einfach vervollständigen, findest du nicht?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "11282769A284FCF6",
      "text": "Sehe ich das richtig?! Du hast wahrhaftig alle\\nArten von Pokémon registriert...?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "11283269A2850FA7",
      "text": "Damit hast du den Blaubeer-Pokédex\\nvervollständigt! Prima, herzlichen Glückwunsch![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "11283169A2850DF4",
      "text": "Dank dir dürften wir nun die Daten aller in der\\nKuppel lebenden Pokémon beisammenhaben![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "1124A469A281E886",
      "text": "Nicht ein einziger Schüler der Blaubeer-Akademie\\nhat das bisher geschafft! Wirklich beeindruckend![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "1124A569A281EA39",
      "text": "Lass mich dir dieses besondere Geschenk zur\\nFeier deines Erfolgs überreichen![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_01",
      "hash64": "15B67CB8135DCF28",
      "text": "Ah, Cyano und [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nWie läuft das Austauschprogramm?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "1124A269A281E520",
      "text": "Clavi, altes Haus! Willkommen!\\nAh, weißt du, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] hat...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_02",
      "hash64": "15B67FB8135DD441",
      "text": "Na, so was![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_03",
      "hash64": "15B67EB8135DD28E",
      "text": "Auch an der Blaubeer-Akademie machst du dich\\neinfach hervorragend, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "1124A369A281E6D3",
      "text": "Hehehe... Ich wusste, dass ich mich nicht geirrt\\nhatte.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_04",
      "hash64": "15B681B8135DD7A7",
      "text": "Direktor Cyano scheint sehr von dir angetan zu\\nsein. Erlaube auch mir, dir meine Glückwünsche\\r\\nauszusprechen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_05",
      "hash64": "15B680B8135DD5F4",
      "text": "Eine solche Leistung muss mit einer Urkunde\\nbelohnt werden!\\c\\nDu hast bestimmt schon eine Nachricht von der\\nFirma erhalten, die für den Pokédex zuständig ist.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_06",
      "hash64": "15B683B8135DDB0D",
      "text": "Ich habe deine Pokédex-App so konfiguriert,\\ndass du die Urkunde jederzeit aufrufen kannst.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "1124A869A281EF52",
      "text": "Erstaunlich! Du hattest schon immer ein\\nHändchen für Technik, Clavi.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_07",
      "hash64": "15B682B8135DD95A",
      "text": "Ach was, jetzt übertreibst du aber...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_08",
      "hash64": "15B675B8135DC343",
      "text": "Und ich möchte nochmals betonen, dass ich es\\nbevorzuge, vor Schülern nicht so angesprochen\\r\\nzu werden.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "1124A969A281F105",
      "text": "Mensch, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nDeine Schatzsuche war auch an unserer Akademie\\nein voller Erfolg, was?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
